<title>USA: Apple South to buy back more stock.</title>
<headline>Apple South to buy back more stock.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Ga. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apple South Inc said it may purchase up to 750,000 shares, depending on market conditions, of its common stock for general corporate purposes through open market transactions.</p>
<p>In the last 15 months, the company completed the previously announced repurchase of approximately 2 million shares.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchase may be wimopanepending upon market conditions and other factors,</p>
